# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gulag Runners — repository root .gitignore
#
# The Unity project lives in a subfolder ("Gulag runners/"), so every rule here is
# deliberately NOT anchored to the repo root: they start with **/ and keep working
# wherever the project sits.
#
# WHAT MUST BE COMMITTED (never ignore these):
#   Assets/**            everything, including *.meta — without .meta files every
#                        reference in prefabs and scenes breaks for your teammates
#   ProjectSettings/**   project configuration
#   Packages/manifest.json and packages-lock.json
#
# WHAT MUST NOT BE COMMITTED (Unity regenerates it on first open):
#   Library/ Temp/ Obj/ Build/ Logs/ UserSettings/
#   If a teammate does not see these folders after cloning, that is correct.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Unity: generated and reproducible ───────────────────────────────────────
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
**/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
**/[Rr]ecordings/
**/.utmp/
**/sysinfo.txt
**/crashlytics-build.properties
mono_crash.*
*.log

# ── IDE project files, generated by Unity ───────────────────────────────────
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.DotSettings.user
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
.vs/
.gradle/
.idea/
**/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# ── Unity: temporary files inside Assets ────────────────────────────────────
**/[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/link.xml*
**/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*
**/[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp*
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ii]nit[Tt]est[Ss]cene*.unity*
**/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]ceneDependencyCache*
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Flow/UnitOptions.db*
**/[Aa]ssets/Unity.VisualScripting.Generated/VisualScripting.Core/Property\ Providers*
InitTestScene*.unity*
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# ── Builds ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.apk
*.aab
*.app
*.ipa

# ── WARNING: .unitypackage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .unitypackage archives are ignored on purpose: they are large and they duplicate
# what is already imported under Assets/. If someone drops an asset pack into the
# repository AS a .unitypackage, nobody else will ever see it.
# Do this instead: import the pack in Unity and commit the unpacked files under
# Assets/ (for CC0 packs), or leave it out and record it in CREDITS.md so everyone
# installs it themselves (for Asset Store packs, which may not be redistributed).
*.unitypackage
*.unitypackage.meta

# ── Third-party packs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Unity Asset Store EULA allows shipping a pack inside your game but forbids
# redistributing it, so Asset Store packs stay out of the repository. CC0 packs may
# be committed — put them in the CC0/ subfolder.
# Licence bookkeeping lives in CREDITS.md and docs/10-free-assets.md.
**/[Aa]ssets/_ThirdParty/**
!**/[Aa]ssets/_ThirdParty/CC0/
!**/[Aa]ssets/_ThirdParty/CC0/**
!**/[Aa]ssets/_ThirdParty/**/*.meta

# ── Operating system ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
